  "youtube_description": "We stayed at Eco Retreat Pollachi to experience the Tamil Village life and Kongunadu Cuisine. It was great. We visited Aliyar river which is walkable distance from the farm camp, visited a dairy farm,  learned Milking of Cow, Pitched Tents.  \n\nBookings and More Details : https://www.tripjodi.in/trip-jodi-video/eco-retreat-pollachi-tamilnadu-village-experience/\n\nCuddled in the lap of nature, the Eco Retreat in Pollachi is a haven away from the hustle and bustle of urban life. Situated in Pollachi amidst hundreds of coconut trees, the Eco Retreat is an ultimate place to recouple with Mother Nature. \n\n\n\nEco Retreat Farm Camp Pollachi:\n-----------------------------------------------------\nCamp Highlights and Attractions 🤩\n\n🏡Eco Friendly Camp stay amidst 1000s of Coconut trees\n🏞 River Bath\n🚶‍♂ Farm Walk\n🤽 Waterfall Visit\n🏏 Indoor Games \n🌴Tender Coconut \n🥘 Authentic Kongu Style foods\n🔥 Campfire with Music \n\nTariff: 1399/- per person \nCheck-in 12:00 PM - Check out 11:00 AM\n\nCost Includes: \n👉 Stay in Tent \n👉 T Campfire \n👉 Indoor Games \n👉  Shower Bath\n👉 Dinner \n 👉 Breakfast \n 👉 Tea Coffee with  Snacks 👉  Tender Coconut \n\nCall or WhatsApp us more details:\n8825788197 | 7601881994\n\nFor Bookings Call: 088257 88197 \nFollow on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/EcoRetreatz/\nFollow on instagram: http://instagram.com/ecoretreatz\n\n\nSubscribe and support at  https://goo.gl/XDQP1V\nTraveling life of Ebin Ephrem Elavathingal and Johncy John\nTelegram Channel : https://t.me/tripjodi\n\nFollow us : \nFacebook : https://www.facebook.com/tripjodi\nInstagram : https://www.instagram.com/tripjodi\nhttps://www.twitter.com/tripjodi\nhttps://www.tripoto.com/profile/tripjodi\n\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\n\nWhen you are using this track, we simply ask that you put this in your description:\n\nTrack: Besomorph & Coopex - Redemption (ft. Riell) [NCS Release]\nMusic provided by NoCopyrightSounds.\nWatch: https://youtu.be/ZGrWry_4Q8s\nFree Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/RedemptionYO\n\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\n#pollachi #tamilnadutourism #tripjodi",
